      "content": "it's a good start, def gets the vibe. but honestly, it's a bit short for what we need. the engine flagged it as \"shallow\" because the word count is pretty low. \n\ncan you try it again, but maybe lean more into the history of the Hollows? like, give more detail about the legends or why people are afraid of the place. try to make it feel more substantial/weighty so it passes the depth check, but again—just keep it actually good. don't just repeat yourself or use empty adjectives, that'll look bad in the final script.",
