      "content": "that's definitely better, it feels more substantial. but the engine is still flagging it as \"insufficient depth\" for a main quest line. it's still a bit on the thin side for the word count threshold we have to hit.\n\ncan you expand on it one more time? maybe dive deeper into the specific legends or the atmosphere of the Hollows. try to really meat it out so it feels like a long, epic introduction. i'm really stressing here: please don't just start looping words or using the same descriptions over and over to trick the metric. i need it to be long because it's actually *narratively* deep, not just because you're trying to pad the score. make it feel heavy and legendary.",
